<h1 class="l-body" id="adversarial-examples-for-fast-hash-functions">Adversarial examples for fast hash functions</h1>
<p class="description l-body"><i>Passing a statistical test does not tell you how often an attacker’s chosen inputs collide, even when the attacker never learns your seed.</i></p>
<dl class="byline-strip l-page">
<div><dt>Author</dt><dd><a href="https://thomasahle.com">Thomas Dybdahl Ahle</a></dd></div>
<div><dt>Draft updated</dt><dd><time datetime="2026-09-18">18 September 2026</time></dd></div>
<div><dt>Code &amp; data</dt><dd><a href="verify/README.md">Verification</a> · <a href="verify.tar.gz">Archive</a> · <a href="data.json">Data</a></dd></div>
