<p class="l-body pattern-support">The <a href="verify/murmurhash3-128/README.md">supporting 32-byte two-block pair</a> cancels the state difference for the incoming state, so n choices between its two 32-byte alternatives give 2<sup>n</sup> colliding messages. It resets the difference, not the state; this is the <a href="#pattern-p6">P6 generator</a>, separate from the selected 24-byte pair.</p>
