<pre aria-label="Numbered pseudo-code" class="l-middle pseudocode" tabindex="0"><code class="nohighlight"><span class="code-line" id="code-highway-1"><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-number">01</span>// Input: M[96]; secret key[4], four independent 64-bit words.</span>
<span class="code-line" id="code-highway-2"><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-number">02</span>mul0 = {0xdbe6d5d5fe4cce2f, 0xa4093822299f31d0, // Public constants.</span>
