<span class="code-line" id="code-highway-15"><span aria-hidden="true" class="line-number">15</span>        mul0[i] ^= (v1[i] &amp; 0xffffffff) * (v0[i] &gt;&gt; 32); // Exploit: zero, then equal products.</span>
