<p class="l-body">The selected 32-byte witness gives an estimated cap of 29.7 bits from <span class="math" data-tex="5/2^{30}">5/2<sup>30</sup></span> events. Its transformed exact Poisson 95% interval is [28.5, 31.3] bits. This is uncertainty in the witness-derived cap, not a confidence interval for the unknown worst pair.</p></section>
