<p class="l-body">This checks the SMHasher3 value, asserts the recorded outputs, prints the literal pair and samples exactly <span class="math" data-tex="2^{20}">2<sup>20</sup></span> seeds per case. Expected output and the distinction from the larger historical runs are in the README.</p>
